{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼俺だ／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の始球式。\n名前入りユニフォームもらいました。\nうっわーすっげ嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京ドームでガールズルール踊った時\n気持ちよかったなあ。\n広すぎて来ているみなさんには\n私たちが豆粒にしか見えないだろうと\n思って超おもいっきり大きく踊ろうと\n思ったけどやり過ぎるのも良くないので\nそんな気持ちで楽しく元気いっぱい\n踊りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽天さん見事勝利！\n嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣着るとしたらまりかは\nどういう髪型するかなー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うなじ見せて\n色気ぷんぷんにするよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声好きって言われる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われる！嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分って声高いんだなって\nびっくりしたことがある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ハマってるたべものとかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマトとトマトジュースとリンゴ酢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服とか買いに行くと1人？！\n友達と？！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人で行くこと多いよー\nあ、でも今度生駒と\nショッピングしてくるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かペットを飼っている\n若しくは飼っていた事ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生のとき\nハムスター2匹買ってました。\nジャンガリアンのラッキーちゃん\nホワイトのハッピーちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユルい男の子は好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分がゆるめだから\n合うなーて思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までで１番楽しかった仕事は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮ってもらうの楽しいです。\nあと、仕事というか、\nライブだいすきです。\nリハさえもすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年かき氷食べたかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べてない！\n高級かき氷食べてみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苔もそうやけど、まりっかの\n撮る写真好き。カメラは趣味なん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁ。嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラ趣味じゃない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏といえばコレ！\nという飲み物はある？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フロート！あんま飲まないけど。\nアイスのっかってるしそんなイメージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホラー映画好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これじゃ13金踊れないね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声優やるとしたらどんなキャラクター\nがいいかって質問答えてくれた方\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やんちゃな少年とか\n美咲子みたいな少女とか\n抜けてる少女とか動物とか\n面白そう。やってみたいなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真撮影で浴衣着たよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/10/6537290/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ここ白すぎww」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなも大喜利してみよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}